        "6": {
          "id": "6",
          "name": "style.css",
          "contents": "/* FIND AND FIX THE BUGS FOR THE ANCHOR TAG STATES */\n\na:link {\n  font-family:Arial;\n  color:#0014ff;\n  font-size: 18px;\n}\n\na:visited {\n  font-family: Arial;\n  color: blueviolet;\n  font-size: 18px;\n}\n\na.hover {\n  color: #f7f8fd;\n  background-color: #2f35ff;\n  font-size: 24px;\n  text-decoration-style: wavy;\n  border-radius: 7px;\n}\n\na.active {\n  color: red;\n  background-color:#d1fcff;\n  font-size: 24px;\n  text-decoration-style: wavy;\n  border-radius: 7px;\n}\n\n/* body style */\nbody {\n  background-color: #d9e7ff;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-family: Arial;\n  font-size: 36px;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\np {\n  font-family: Arial;\n  font-size: 18px;\n}\n\n.gallery {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: row;\n  justify-content: space-around;\n  align-items: center;\n}\n\n.link-card {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n\n\nimg {\n  border-style: solid;\n  border-radius: 15px;\n  width: 300px;\n  margin: 15px;\n}\n\n.citation {\n  height:300px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: flex-end;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n\n.citation > p {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-style: italic;\n}\n\n/* styles for the new lift-and-aerodynamics.html,\n   refraction-and-diffraction.html, and time-dilation.html pages */\n.back-link {\n  margin: 15px;\n  font-family: Arial;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: #0014ff;\n  text-decoration: none;\n}\n\n.back-link:hover {\n  text-decoration: underline;\n}\n\n.page-image {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n\n.page-image img {\n  width: 400px;\n}",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        },
        "7": {
          "id": "7",
          "name": "index.html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n  <head>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    \n    <!-- Title -->\n    <h1>Becoming Super: The Science Behind Superhero Abilities</h1>\n    \n    <!-- informational paragraph -->\n    <p>Imagine leaping over skyscrapers, running faster than the speed of sound, or even manipulating matter with your mind. While these abilities are the hallmarks of our favorite superheroes, many of them can be explained by science! This page dips into the science behind some famous superhero powers.</p> \n    \n    <!-- gallery for image and link -->\n    <div class=\"gallery\">\n      <div class=\"link-card\">\n        <div>\n          <img src=\"superman.png\" alt=\"Superman\">\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <p>To understand how Superman defies gravity, we have to understand lift and aerodynamics! By understanding <a href=\"lift-and-aerodynamics.html\">Bernoullis' principle,</a> which states that an increase in speed of a fluid (or air) results in a decrease in pressure, we can unravel the mystery behind Superman's ability to fly.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"link-card\">\n        <div>\n          <img src=\"invisibleWoman.png\" alt=\"The Invisible Woman\">\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <p>The Invisible Woman takes us on a fun journey into the realm of optics. By manipulating light waves and bending them around her body, she can render herself invisble to the naked eye. Explore concepts like <a href=\"refraction-and-diffraction.html\">refraction and diffraction </a> to unravel the scientific principles the lie behind the Invisible Woman's ability to vanish from plain sight!</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    \n      <div class=\"link-card\">\n        <div>\n          <img src=\"flash.png\" alt=\"The Flash\">\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <p>The Flash introduces us to the concept of time dilation. According to <a href=\"time-dilation.html\"> Einstein's theory of relativity</a>, as an object approaches the speed of light, time slows down for that object relative to an oberserver at rest.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>  \n\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"citation\">\n      <p>All images CC-BY-SA from fandom.com</p>\n    </div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  </body>\n</html>",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "8": {
          "id": "8",
